---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 - Mango">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <article class="card p-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-6">🥭 关于 Mango</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
          一个简洁优雅的微信朋友圈风格图片博客主题
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-4">✨ 特性</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>📱 <strong>响应式设计</strong> - 完美适配手机、平板、电脑</li>
          <li>🌙 <strong>暗黑模式</strong> - 保护眼睛，自动切换</li>
          <li>💬 <strong>微信朋友圈风格</strong> - 熟悉的交互体验</li>
          <li>⚡ <strong>极速加载</strong> - Astro 构建的静态站点</li>
          <li>📝 <strong>Markdown 支持</strong> - 方便的内容编写</li>
          <li>🖼️ <strong>图片画廊</strong> - 优雅的图片展示</li>
          <li>🎨 <strong>高度可定制</strong> - 通过 Sveltia CMS 管理</li>
          <li>☁️ <strong>Cloudflare 部署</strong> - 快速稳定的托管</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-4">🚀 技术栈</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li><strong>框架:</strong> Astro</li>
          <li><strong>样式:</strong> Tailwind CSS</li>
          <li><strong>CMS:</strong> Sveltia CMS</li>
          <li><strong>部署:</strong> Cloudflare Pages</li>
          <li><strong>图床:</strong> Cloudflare R2</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-4">📮 联系</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          如果你有任何问题或建议，欢迎通过以下方式联系我：
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mt-4">
          <li>📧 Email: your@email.com</li>
          <li>🐙 GitHub: <a href="https://github.com" class="link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@yourusername</a></li>
          <li>🐦 Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com" class="link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@yourusername</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <p class="text-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">
            🥭 Made with love by Mango Theme
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
